21	6.0.5 (in development)
22	----------------------
23	- Revert #27397, which changed the way config keys such as NODE_JS were parsed
24	  when reading the config file.  This change broke emsdk installations that
25	  contained spaces. (#27421)
26	
27	6.0.4 - 07/24/26
28	----------------
29	- The emscripten config file parser can now handle strings that contain
30	  environment variables (e.g. `$HOME`) and that use the `~/` prefix.  This means
31	  that it should be possible, in most cases, to avoid the use of python's
32	  `os.path` within the the config file itself. (#27215)
33	- Legacy support for ancient vendor-prefixed DOM APIs was removed (#27341,
34	  #27339, #27338, #27340, #27347)
35	- Removed legacy JS library symbols symbols: `$ALLOC_NORMAL`, `$ALLOC_STACK`,
36	  and `$allocate`. (#27378)
37	- llvm-libc was updated to LLVM 22.1.8. (#27374)
38	- mimalloc was updated to 3.4.1. (#27380)
39	- Backport fix for musl's qsort (CVE-2026-40200) (#27029)
40	- `recvmmsg` and `sendmmsg` are now implemented in terms of `recvmsg` and
