21	6.0.12 (in development)
22	----------------------
23	- The embind library functions `getInheritedInstanceCount` and
24	  `getLiveInheritedInstances` were marked as deprecated. (#27899)
25	- `MAXIMUM_MEMORY` is now honored with `IMPORTED_MEMORY` even without
26	  `ALLOW_MEMORY_GROWTH`: the module accepts an imported memory of any size up to
27	  the maximum, but never grows it. Previously the maximum was ignored, with a
28	  warning, and only a memory of exactly `INITIAL_MEMORY` was accepted.
29	  (#27859)
30	- Added experimental `emscripten_epoll_listener_add` and
31	  `emscripten_epoll_listener_remove` in the new `<emscripten/epoll.h>`. These
32	  listeners deliver an epoll set's readiness to a callback, supported on the
33	  main thread only. The callback itself is then able to collect the events via
34	  a zero-timeout `epoll_wait`, without an `ASYNCIFY`/`JSPI` requirement.
35	  (#27547)
36	
37	6.0.11 - 10/02/26
38	-----------------
39	- Built-in SCons support (`emscons` and `tools/scons`) was marked as deprecated.
40	  (See #27835)
